# Who reviews what.
#
# One maintainer, so every path resolves to the same person. The file still
# earns its place: it makes the review requirement automatic rather than
# remembered, and when a second maintainer arrives the change is one line here
# instead of a convention nobody wrote down.
#
# CONTRIBUTING.md states that the maintainer may self-approve, because this is
# a single-maintainer repository and pretending otherwise would make the branch
# protection rule unsatisfiable.

